            "-- canonical writer interface. Verify their exact "
            "ACL shape after each\n    -- finalization so an unl"
            "isted runtime/group grant cannot survive a rerun.\n"
            "    IF NOT has_function_privilege(\n        v_gener"
            "al_runtime_role,\n        'public.context_dnd_mutat"
            "e(uuid,text,text,timestamptz,text,real,jsonb)'::re"
