            "legacy fence and v2 functions in place.  A later r"
            "e-upgrade\n    -- receives only this one-shot versi"
            "oned activation path.\n    EXECUTE format('GRANT US"
            "AGE ON SCHEMA runtime_attention_admin TO %I', v_mi"
