            "GES ON FUNCTION '\n            || 'public.runtime_a"
            "ttention_plant_legacy_debounce_marker() FROM PUBLI"
            "C';\n        -- Adopt the current body last, after "
            "the ALTERs above have proven the\n        -- rename"
            "d function exists.  Doing it earlier would let a m"
            "issing rename\n        -- adoption create a second "
            "function under the new name while the trigger\n    "
