            "       p_state text\n        )\n        \nRETURNS TAB"
            "LE(\n    outcome text,\n    message_id uuid,\n    con"
            "versation_id uuid,\n    request_id uuid,\n    target"
            "_butler text,\n    target_kind text,\n    route_inbo"
